<title>GREECE: ALPHA CREDIT BANK RELOCATES SYNTAGMA BRANCH.</title>
<headline>ALPHA CREDIT BANK RELOCATES SYNTAGMA BRANCH.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha Credit Bank said in a statement that accounts held with its Syntagma Square branch previously located at 2 Stadiou Street have been transferred to its new branch at 3 Panepistimiou &amp; Amerikis since the beginning of August 1997. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
